    one-shot stale auto-refresh). The web leaf is a controlled presentational component fed
    columns/layout by its parent (DataTable); these axes come from the parent query/connection.
  • Binding: view → DataTableColumnMenuModel (P1/S8 state-holder seam); no HTTP/persistence in
    the view. Telemetry: model.start() emits P1/S11 `view.opened` surface="DataTableColumnMenu".
  • A11y: VoiceOver labels on every interactive element (trigger, checkbox, ↑, ↓, reset,
    refresh), Dynamic Type via Font.TS roles, reduce-motion via TSFadeIn.

